{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ca-integration-api-collection-v1",
    "name": "西域数智化投标管理平台 - CA证书对外API v2.0",
    "description": "CA 证书对外查询接口完整测试集合。\n\n**前置步骤**：\n1. 先使用内部账号登录获取 JWT Token（「内部管理」→「管理员登录」）\n2. 用 JWT Token 创建含 `ca:read` scope 的 API Key（「内部管理」→「创建 API Key」）\n3. 将返回的 `secret` 填入 Collection Variables 的 `apiKeySecret`\n4. 运行「CA 对外接口」目录下的所有请求\n\n**认证规则**：\n- 内部管理接口：使用 `Authorization: Bearer <JWT Token>`，需管理员角色\n- 对外查询接口：使用 `X-API-Key: <apiKeySecret>`，需包含 `ca:read` scope",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:18089",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "后端 API 基础地址（本地联调 18089 / 测试环境 / 生产）"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwtToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "【请先登录获取】内部 JWT Token，用于创建 API Key。格式：不含 Bearer 前缀的纯 token 字符串"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminUsername",
      "value": "admin",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "管理员用户名（本地 dev: admin / 测试: 实际管理员账号）"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "XiyuAdmin2026!",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "管理员密码（本地 dev: XiyuAdmin2026! / 测试: 实际密码）"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKeySecret",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "【创建 API Key 后自动填入】格式 xiyu_sk_xxxxxxxx。仅创建时返回一次，请妥善保存"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKeyId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "创建的 API Key ID（用于禁用/启用/删除）"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 内部管理（前置步骤）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 管理员登录获取 JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"登录成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true, \"success 应为 true\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"token\", \"必须返回 token 字段\");",
                  "    // 自动把 token 写入 collection variable",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwtToken\", json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log(\"JWT Token 已自动保存:\", json.data.token.substring(0, 30) + \"...\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "管理员登录，返回 JWT Token。成功后会自动写入 `jwtToken` variable。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 创建含 ca:read scope 的 API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"API Key 创建成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"secret\", \"必须返回 secret 字段（只返回一次）\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.secret).to.match(/^xiyu_sk_/, \"secret 必须以 xiyu_sk_ 开头\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.scopes).to.include(\"ca:read\", \"必须包含 ca:read scope\");",
                  "    // 自动写入 variables",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"apiKeySecret\", json.data.secret);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"apiKeyId\", json.data.id);",
                  "    console.log(\"\\n============================================================\");",
                  "    console.log(\"  API Key 已创建！请妥善保存以下信息：\");",
                  "    console.log(\"  ID:\", json.data.id);",
                  "    console.log(\"  SECRET:\", json.data.secret);",
                  "    console.log(\"  SCOPES:\", JSON.stringify(json.data.scopes));",
                  "    console.log(\"  过期时间:\", json.data.expiresAt || \"永不过期\");",
                  "    console.log(\"  ⚠️  此 Secret 只返回一次，关闭后无法再获取！\");",
                  "    console.log(\"============================================================\\n\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"返回 notice 提示用户保存 secret\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"notice\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwtToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman 测试 CA 查询对接\",\n  \"scopes\": [\"ca:read\"],\n  \"expiresAt\": \"2027-08-05T00:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "api-keys"]
            },
            "description": "创建含 `ca:read` scope 的 API Key。**注意**：expiresAt 在此脚本中设置为「24 小时后过期」，请按需修改。\n\n响应中的 `secret` 会自动写入 `apiKeySecret` variable。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.3 查看所有 API Key（验证创建成功）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"列出 API Key 成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "    // 验证列表中不返回 secret（安全约束）",
                  "    json.data.forEach(function(k) {",
                  "        pm.expect(k).to.not.have.property(\"secret\", \"列表接口禁止返回 secret!\");",
                  "    });",
                  "    console.log(\"当前共有 API Key 数量:\", json.data.length);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwtToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "api-keys"]
            },
            "description": "验证 API Key 已创建成功。**安全约束**：列表接口不返回 secret 字段。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. CA 对外接口（X-API-Key 认证）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 CA 证书列表查询（分页+筛选）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"列表查询成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.all.keys(",
                  "        \"content\", \"totalElements\", \"totalPages\", \"page\", \"size\", \"hasNext\", \"hasPrevious\"",
                  "    , \"分页字段必须完整\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.content).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.size).to.be.at.most(100, \"size 必须 <= 100\");",
                  "    console.log(\"当前页条数:\", json.data.content.length, \"/ 总计:\", json.data.totalElements);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"所有 CA 证书密码脱敏为 ******\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    json.data.content.forEach(function(ca) {",
                  "        pm.expect(ca.caPassword).to.eql(\"******\", \"CA ID=\" + ca.id + \" 密码未脱敏！实际=\" + ca.caPassword);",
                  "    });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"content 中已下架 (INACTIVE) 的 CA 不出现\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    json.data.content.forEach(function(ca) {",
                  "        pm.expect(ca.status).to.not.eql(\"INACTIVE\", \"已下架 CA 不应出现在列表中\");",
                  "    });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"每条记录包含核心字段\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data.content.length === 0) {",
                  "        console.log(\"⚠️  列表为空，跳过字段结构检查。请先添加 CA 证书数据\");",
                  "        return;",
                  "    }",
                  "    var first = json.data.content[0];",
                  "    pm.expect(first).to.have.all.keys(",
                  "        \"id\", \"relatedPlatforms\", \"caType\", \"sealType\", \"electronicAccount\",",
                  "        \"caPassword\", \"issuer\", \"holderName\", \"expiryDate\", \"caPlatformUrl\",",
                  "        \"custodianId\", \"custodianName\", \"custodianEmployeeNumber\",",
                  "        \"borrowStatus\", \"status\", \"remarks\", \"createdAt\", \"updatedAt\",",
                  "        \"borrowerName\", \"borrowerEmployeeNumber\", \"borrowTime\"",
                  "    , \"核心字段必须存在（借用人字段允许为 null）\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKeySecret}}",
                "description": "对外 API Key（格式 xiyu_sk_xxxxxxxx）"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/integration/ca-certificates?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "ca-certificates"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": "页码（从 0 开始，负数被截断为 0）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "每页条数（1-100，>100 截断为 100，<=0 提升为 1）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选筛选】状态：ACTIVE 正常 / EXPIRING 即将到期 / EXPIRED 已过期"
                },
                {
                  "key": "borrowStatus",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选筛选】借用状态：IN_STOCK 在库 / BORROWED 在借 / RETURNING 归还中"
                },
                {
                  "key": "keyword",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选筛选】关键词搜索（持有人/颁发机构/保管人姓名，模糊匹配）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "caType",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选筛选】CA 类型：ENTITY_CA 企业CA / PERSON_CA 个人CA / TAX_CA 税务CA"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sealType",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选筛选】印章类型：OFFICIAL_SEAL 公章 / LEGAL_SEAL 法人章 / FINANCE_SEAL 财务章"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "createdAt,desc",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "【可选】排序字段+方向，默认 createdAt,desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "分页查询 CA 证书列表。支持多维度筛选 + 分页 + 排序。\n\n**密码字段**：返回 `caPassword=******`（脱敏）。\n**下架排除**：`status=INACTIVE` 的已下架证书自动不返回。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 CA 证书统计概览",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"概览查询成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.all.keys(",
                  "        \"total\", \"expiring\", \"expired\", \"borrowed\"",
                  "    , \"必须返回四个统计维度\");",
                  "    // 类型和范围校验",
                  "    Object.keys(json.data).forEach(function(k) {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data[k]).to.be.a(\"number\", k + \" 必须是数字\");",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data[k]).to.be.at.least(0, k + \" 不能为负数\");",
                  "    });",
                  "    console.log(\"CA 证书概览：总=\" + json.data.total +",
                  "        \" / 即将到期=\" + json.data.expiring +",
                  "        \" / 已过期=\" + json.data.expired +",
                  "        \" / 在借=\" + json.data.borrowed);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"各分项之和不应大于总数\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    var sum = json.data.expiring + json.data.expired + json.data.borrowed;",
                  "    pm.expect(sum).to.be.at.most(json.data.total, \"分项之和 > 总数？数据逻辑异常\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKeySecret}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/integration/ca-certificates/overview",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "ca-certificates", "overview"]
            },
            "description": "统计 CA 证书库四个维度的数量：\n- **total**：证书总数\n- **expiring**：即将到期（≤30天内过期）\n- **expired**：已过期\n- **borrowed**：当前在借"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 CA 证书详情（按 ID）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// 如果未手动设置 caDetailId，自动从列表接口取第一条 ID",
                  "var existingId = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"caDetailId\");",
                  "if (!existingId) {",
                  "    console.log(\"caDetailId 未设置，跳过自动设置（请先跑列表并手动选 ID 填入 caDetailId variable，或直接改 URL 中的 1）\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"详情查询成功 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.id).to.be.a(\"number\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"详情密码脱敏为 ******\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.caPassword).to.eql(\"******\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"详情包含借用人字段（允许 null）\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"borrowerName\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"borrowerEmployeeNumber\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"borrowTime\");",
                  "    if (json.data.borrowStatus === \"BORROWED\") {",
                  "        // 在借状态下借用人信息必填",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data.borrowerName).to.not.be.null;",
                  "        console.log(\"当前借用人:\", json.data.borrowerName, \"(\", json.data.borrowerEmployeeNumber, \")\");",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKeySecret}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/integration/ca-certificates/1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "ca-certificates", "1"]
            },
            "description": "按 ID 查询单条 CA 证书完整信息。请将路径中的 `1` 替换为实际存在的 CA 证书 ID。\n\n可先跑 1.1 列表查看有哪些 ID。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 异常边界测试（负向用例）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 无 X-API-Key 返回 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"缺少 API Key → 401\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(false);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(401);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.msg).to.include(\"X-API-Key\").and.to.not.be.empty;",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ 401 错误信息:\", json.msg);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/integration/ca-certificates",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "ca-certificates"]
            },
            "description": "故意不提供 X-API-Key，验证返回 401 以及友好的错误提示。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 错误的 API Key 返回 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"无效 API Key → 401\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(false);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(401);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ 401 错误信息:\", json.msg);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "xiyu_sk_this_is_an_invalid_key_1234567890"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/integration/ca-certificates",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "ca-certificates"]
            },
            "description": "使用格式正确但数据库中不存在的 Key，验证 401 响应。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 缺少 ca:read scope 的 Key → 403",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// 说明：此用例需要先手动创建一个不含 ca:read scope 的 API Key",
                  "// 并将其填入 collection variable 'apiKeyNoCaReadScope'",
                  "// 推荐创建命令：POST /api/admin/api-keys { name: \"No CA Scope\", scopes: [\"tender:read\"] }",
                  "var key = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"apiKeyNoCaReadScope\");",
                  "if (!key) {",
                  "    console.log(\"⚠️  请先创建不含 ca:read scope 的 Key 并设置 apiKeyNoCaReadScope variable。本用例跳过。\");",
                  "    pm.test.skip(\"缺少 apiKeyNoCaReadScope variable，已跳过此用例\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"不含 ca:read scope → 403\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(false);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ 403 缺少 scope →\", json.msg);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKeyNoCaReadScope}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
